---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: ScaffoldingPlan[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for introduceComplications. Introduce a creative but fair complication only after checking remaining time, resources, and prerequisites. Offer multiple recovery paths, revise logistics, and preserve the intended competencies rather than making the project impossible or changing its purpose. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
